### 계정 등록
POST {{host}}{{base_path}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "john_doe",
  "userPassword": "password123!",
  "userEmail": "john@example.com",
  "userName": "John Doe"
}

###

### 계정 등록 - 필수값 누락 (400 예상)
POST {{host}}{{base_path}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "",
  "userPassword": "password123!",
  "userEmail": "john@example.com",
  "userName": "John Doe"
}

###

### 계정 등록 - 이메일 형식 오류 (400 예상)
POST {{host}}{{base_path}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "jane_doe",
  "userPassword": "password123!",
  "userEmail": "invalid-email",
  "userName": "Jane Doe"
}